            <div class="hero-content" >
                <div class="hero-text">
                    <span class="hero-label">Awaken Your True Essence</span>
                    <h1>Your sacred journey to inner peace and healing</h1>
                    <p>As a certified Tantra practitioner, I guide women through transformative experiences that reconnect mind, body, and spirit. Through personalized sessions, you'll discover profound self-love, release emotional blocks, and awaken your divine feminine energy.</p>
