            <h2>Sacred Offerings for Your Healing Journey</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Each pathway offers a unique approach to healing. Explore my offerings and discover what resonates with your soul.</p>

            <div class="offerings-panel">
                <div class="offerings-grid">
                    <article class="offering-card">
                        <div class="offering-card-top">
