<!-- About Section -->
    <section class="about-section" id="about">
        <div class="container">
            <span class="section-label">MY STORY</span>
            <h2>From Burnout to Healing</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">My Journey into spirituality</p>
            
            <div class="about-content">
                <div class="about-image">
                    <img src="https://shantipaththerapy.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/image_2-225x300.jpg" alt="About me" class="about-img">
                </div>
                <div class="about-text">
                    <p>A few years ago, I was completely burned out. Work consumed everything—I couldn't sleep, had no personal life, and my days blurred into an endless cycle of just getting through. I knew something had to change. This couldn't be all there was to life.</p>
                    <p>That's when I discovered Tantra Yoga. I started practicing, and slowly, things began to shift. Through the breathwork, the energy practices, and eventually Tantra massage, I found my way back to myself. My body started to heal, sleep returned, and I reconnected with a sense of aliveness I'd forgotten existed.</p>
                    <p>After experiencing this profound healing in my own life, I felt called to share it with others. I trained, deepened my practice, and now I'm here—offering this same path of healing through Shanti Path.</p>
                    <p>If you're feeling lost, exhausted, or disconnected, I understand. And I'm here to guide you back home to yourself. </p>
                    <a href="#" class="btn-read">Read More</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div>
