    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="faq-section" id="faq">
        <div class="container">
            <span class="section-label">what you need to know</span>
            <h2>F&Q</h2>
            
            <div class="faq-list">
                <div class="faq-item active">
                    <button class="faq-question">
                        <span>Is Tantra Massage erotic?</span>
                        <span class="faq-icon">−</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>No, while Tantra Massage works with the sacred life force energy of the body, it is not erotic, the intention is focused on healing, awakening, and creating consciousness. There is no sexual component to these sessions, and clear boundaries are maintained at all times.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">
                        <span>What does a Tantra massage look like?</span>
                        <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>A Tantra massage session includes breathwork, meditation, and gentle bodywork focused on energy flow and emotional release.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">
                        <span>How often should I book a session?</span>
                        <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>This depends on your personal journey and goals. Many clients start with monthly sessions and adjust based on their needs.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">
                        <span>What if I want to "relax or fitness session"?</span>
                        <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>While relaxation is a natural outcome, Tantra healing focuses on deeper transformation rather than just relaxation.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">
                        <span>How do I know if Tantra is right for me?</span>
                        <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>If you feel called to deeper self-discovery and healing, Tantra may be right for you. Schedule a consultation to discuss.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">
                        <span>Do you work with men or just with women?</span>
                        <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Currently, I work exclusively with women to create a safe, sacred feminine healing space.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">
                        <span>What kind of healing or works do I need to do?</span>
                        <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>There's no specific preparation required. Come with an open heart and willingness to explore.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question">
                        <span>What if the emotions during this session?</span>
                        <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Emotional release is a natural and welcome part of the healing process. You'll be held in a safe, supportive space.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <a href="#" class="btn-read">Read More</a>
        </div>
    </section>

