            <span class="section-label">JOIN YOUR JOURNEY</span>
            <h2>How It Works</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Your healing journey is unique, and I honour that. Here's how we begin working together to create lasting transformation in your life.</p>
            
            <div class="how-title">How to start?</div>
            
            <div class="steps-line">
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-circle">1</div>
                    <div class="step-text">
                        <h3>Book an initial interview</h3>
                        <p>Start by scheduling a free 20-minute interview consultation. During this call, you can share what brings you to Tantra healing and ask any questions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-circle">2</div>
                    <div class="step-text">
                        <h3>Schedule Your First Session</h3>
                        <p>After our interview, if we feel aligned, you can schedule your first session. I'll recommend the path that best suits your needs and intentions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-circle">3</div>
                    <div class="step-text">
                        <h3>Your Session Experience</h3>
                        <p>Arrive at a peaceful, private space where your healing journey unfolds. Each session is tailored specifically to you and your personal goals.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-circle">4</div>
                    <div class="step-text">
                        <h3>Next Steps</h3>
                        <p>With continued support and integration practices, your healing continues beyond our sessions as you embody your transformation.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why Interview Section -->
    <section class="interview-section" id="interview">
        <div class="container">
            <span class="section-label">WHY AN INTERVIEW?</span>
            <h2>Why Tantra Needs An Interview</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">True healing requires trust, connection, and safety. An interview ensures we're the right match before beginning this sacred work together.</p>
            
            <div class="interview-grid">
                <div class="interview-card">
                    <h3>Safety First</h3>
                    <p>Tantra healing requires trust and vulnerability. During the interview, I want to ensure you feel completely safe and comfortable with my approach. It's a chance for us to establish a foundation of trust.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="interview-card">
                    <h3>Clarity and Intentions</h3>
                    <p>I want to understand your unique needs, history, and intentions. The interview helps us explore what you hope to achieve through our work together, allowing me to tailor your experience appropriately.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="interview-card">
                    <h3>Mutual Alignment</h3>
                    <p>Not every practitioner is right for every client, and vice versa. This meeting helps us ensure we're a good fit for each other before committing to deeper work together.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <p class="interview-note">Your healing journey begins with a 20-minute video consultation.</p>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Request an Interview</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Reviews Section -->
    <section class="reviews-section background-alt">
        <div class="container">
            <span class="section-label">CLIENT REVIEWS</span>
            <h2>Reviews</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">I am incredibly grateful to every woman who has trusted me on her healing journey. Here are some of their experiences.</p>
            
            <div class="reviews-grid">
                <div class="review-card">
                    <p>"It changed my life. I felt like I was carrying the weight of the world, and after just three sessions, I finally feel free. Thank you for creating such a safe space."</p>
                    <span class="reviewer">— Maria R.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="review-card">
                    <p>"I was skeptical at first, but the healing I've experienced has been profound. I've reconnected with parts of myself I thought I'd lost forever."</p>
                    <span class="reviewer">— Sarah K.</span>
